格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Your pocket agent. Local-first AI agents on iOS and Android — real workspaces, tool execution with approvals, and your choice of model (DSH · Claude Code · Codex · GLM).","id":"gh:1346370853","install_available":false,"language":"Objective-C++","name":"rish-app","slug":"ZSeven-W/rish-app","topics":["agent","agent-runtime","ai","ai-agent","android","claude","claude-code","codex","deepseek","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","glm","ios","llm","local-first","mobile","react-native","rust","vibecoding"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Your pocket agent. Local-first AI agents on iOS and Android — real workspaces, tool execution with a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"pprovals, and your choice of model (DSH · Claude Code · Codex · GLM)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Rish, your pocket agent."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · Français · Español · Deutsch · Português · Русский · हिन्दी · Tü"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"rkçe · ไทย · Tiếng Việt · Bahasa Indonesia"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Rish is an experimental native app for conversations and local workspaces. Its\ninterface is written "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"in Rust with GPUI Mobile on iOS/Android and GPUI Fast for\nthe macOS preview. The repository now cont"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ains the GPUI app and its native\nruntime services; the previous React Native application has been re"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"he GPUI app and its native\nruntime services; the previous React Native application has been removed."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Current scope"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Shared GPUI interface with a compact navigation drawer, a wide-window sidebar,\nlight/dark themes, "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"Lucide icons, and English/Chinese UI strings.\n- Basic native text chat, saved conversations, model/r"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"easoning configuration,\nand native message/name editors on mobile.\n- Provider-owned model catalogs f"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"etched from the configured service or entered\nmanually, with no bundled model choices or automatic f"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"allback model.\n- Create folders and UTF-8 text files, and edit files up to 256 KiB in the\nnative edi"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"tor. Saves check the original revision; failed saves retain a draft.\n- Native platform services reta"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"in ownership of provider credentials, network\ncalls, workspace files, Git, and runtime execution. Se"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"ssion mutations use the\nshared Rust validator and generation/digest compare-and-swap."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"This is a development preview. **The full Agent controller and tool workflows,\nattachments, complete"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" settings, and task Live Activity integration are not yet\ncomplete in the GPUI interface.** An expor"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ted native method is not evidence of\nan end-to-end working feature. Existing account/provider verifi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"cation and\nscreenshots from the old app do not establish GPUI acceptance."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The development app uses `tech.zseven.rish.gpui` and its own data container.\nPreviously installed ap"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ps and their data are not automatically migrated.\nThe macOS build is a UI preview without the mobile"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" runtime. There is no verified\nGPUI TestFlight or signed release pipeline yet."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Build from source"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Run from the repository root:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Mobile builds require explicitly prepared native dependencies. Follow the\ndeveloper guide for toolch"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ains, iOS simulator builds,\nAndroid APKs, and tests. The GPUI guide describes the shared\nsource layo"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ut and host bridge. The migration status\nseparates implemented code from validation still required."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Next milestones and the fini handoff are tracked in the Mobile Agent roadmap."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Model requests send conversation/task context to the configured service.\nLocal files and native exec"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ution do not imply offline model inference. Runtime\navailability depends on the platform, prepared a"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"rtifacts, and enabled build\ncapabilities."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Location | Purpose |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `apps/gpui` | Shared Rust UI and native iOS/Android hosts |\n| `modules/rish/core` | Shared session"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" and runtime rules |\n| `modules/rish/ios` | Objective-C/Objective-C++ services and tests |\n| `module"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"s/rish/android` | Kotlin/JNI services and native dependencies |\n| `modules/rish/shared/GuestAssets` "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"| Shared guest resources |\n| `scripts` | Native dependency preparation and source checks |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Project links"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- Contributing · Development · Distribution status\n- Rish runtime\n- GPUI Mobile · GPUI Fast\n- MIT Li"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"cense · Third-party notices"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
